2|0@WWE^1438781589#cts9svu:wonderloss$:Maybe you have figured this out, but just in case you have not, I will help you out. Golddust and Stardust are brothers, and they are both the sons of Dusty Rhodes. They started teaming up as Golddust and Cody Rhodes to get Cody his job back after he had been fired by The Authority. They won the tag titles together, then lost them. After a bit of a losing streak, Cody kept trying to find new partners to help Golddust be a winner again. Eventually, the partner he found was himself as Stardust. 
